#: ../../../release/dev/aix-shared-library-symlinks.rst:4
msgid ""
"On AIX, the :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` target property "
"and :variable:`CMAKE_AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` variable were added to "
"name plain shared objects with :prop_tgt:`VERSION` and :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION` "
"and create symlinks.  See policy :policy:`CMP0227`."
